What is a <!DOCTYPE html> ?
# It is called the  document type declaration, i.e; it tells the browser that this document is written in HTML5 and please render it using the HTML5 standards.

What is an IDE?
# Integrated Development Environment is a software application which provides all tools needed for writing, editing, running, testing and debugging a code in one place.

Who is a full stack developer?
# A FSD is a SD who can work on both the frontend and backend of an Application. The roles of  a FSD are:-
 ~ Frontend development
 ~ Backend development
 ~ Database management
 ~ API Development (APIs allow the frontend and backend to communicate)
 ~ Version control (They manage the code chnages and collaboration)
