What is an HTML form validation?
# This ensures that the data entered by the user is accurate and in the required format before submission. This helps reduce errors and invalid data being sent to the server. Types are:-
 ~ Required field validation (required)
 ~ Pattern matching validation (pattern)
 ~ Input type validation
 ~ Length Validation (minlength and maxlength)
 ~ Custom error messages by using title attribute.

